# Documentation figures are deliberately tracked: the README embeds the PNGs,
# and the PDFs are kept beside them as the vector originals for the paper.
# Without these exceptions the *.png / *.pdf rules above would hide them and
# every image in the README would 404 for anyone who cloned the repo.
!doc/*.png
!doc/*.pdf

# Local agent instructions, not part of the published repo.
CLAUDE.md
